{
 "id": 748144,
 "titulo": "2.9.5 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1489462455296,
 "modificada": 1732666401873,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/748144",
 "html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break: normal;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">It is time to unveil the full contents of Marvel Future Fight 2.9.5! Although we teased quite a lot of the contents of this update compared to others, there is still a lot that we left out to keep the surprise! Take a read of the update details and let us know what you think! </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;<img id=\"TjX9JoJYmio\" class=\"youtube_thumb\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TjX9JoJYmio/sddefault.jpg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6600;\">3 New Characters</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;Ghost Rider (Robbie Reyes), Hellcat, and Kid Kaiju join Future Fight!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/01.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;* Ghost Rider (Robbie Reyes) and Hellcat is available through Dimension Chest.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;* Kid Kaiju is available through 20 Biometrics Daily </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;* Numbers are based on skill level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">New Team Bonuses and Achievements have been added.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6600;\">5 New Uniforms</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;New Uniforms for Punisher, Luke Cage, Iron Fist, Elektra, and Karnak have been added</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/02.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;*&nbsp;New Uniforms are available discounted price for a short period, you will be able&nbsp;to check their specific features in the Uniform Room.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6600;\"> Character Growth Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">1. New Feature: Character Growth Information and Combat Power Points</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">A new feature has been added so you can see just how strong your characters are in comparison to other p&#108;ayers! You will be able to check out the Combat Power of your characters, which will then be used to see just how highly positioned your character is. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/03.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><br />The Icon next to the information will allow you take a deeper look into the character information. You will be able to see which areas of your character still need work, including Skills, Gears, ISO-8, Custom Gear, Urus, Comic Cards, and Uniforms.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/04.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">2. Character Ranking </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">This new feature can be found in Sub Menu &gt; Character Ranking.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/05.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">In the Character Ranking Screen, your characters rank will be determined based off the Combat Power Points your character has earned. <br />Compete against other Agents and get the highest ranked characters!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6600;\"> Uniform Upgrade Changes</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">The Mandatory Uniforms will no longer be required to upgrade a Uniform. Mandatory Uniforms have been changed to &ldquo;Option Uniforms&rdquo; which are no longer necessary to attain to upgrade a uniform.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/06.png\" />&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Now you will be able to unlock the Bonus Stats only when the Option Uniform is attained. These Bonus Stats will be the same as the previous system. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/07.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break: normal;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #0075c8; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">- If a character's uniform is upgraded to a certain level before the Option uniform is unlocked, a window will show once that unlocked uniform is purchased. This will show you which bonus stats have been unlocked. <br />- If a character's uniform is not upgraded to a certain level which required the new uniform, this window will not show.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6600;\"> Timeline Battle Changes</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">1. Recommended / Restricted Character</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">Each week you will be able to see who will be the recommended and restricted characters in Timeline Battle. <br />If you use the Recommended Characters, you will receive Bonus points for using them.<br />If a character is on the restricted list, you will not be able to use them until the next reset.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/08.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #c00000;\">* This Recommended / Restricted Character list will reset at 1 AM UTC+0 every Friday.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;- Recommended Character:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"> <br />If you win with the Recommended Characters in your team, you will receive bonus points. The list will reset every Friday, and may vary between different Agents. <br /> <!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br /> <!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break: normal;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; color: #c00000; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">※</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #c00000; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\"> Bonus points from using Recommended Characters is limited per day.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break: normal;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #c00000; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break: normal;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;- Restricted Character</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">: <br />Characters in this list will not be able to be used in Timeline Battles. Just like the Recommended Character list, it will reset every Friday. Unlike the Recommended Character list, every p&#108;ayer will have the same Restricted Character list.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">2. Friendly Match</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">Fancy trying out different teams for timeline but are not willing to risk the ranking points? You can choose an opponent on the ladder, from your friend&nbsp;list or from your alliance to engage in a friendly battle. There will be no rewards from a friendly match except bragging rights and honor.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/Resized_09.jpg\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break: normal;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #0070c0; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">-You will be able to fight against agents at the top of the ladder for each league in friendly battles. You will also be able to fight against friends or alliance members in friendly battles. </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break: normal;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #c00000; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">* Opponent&rsquo;s team will be set based on the team they recently used in Timeline Battle. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break: normal;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #c00000; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">*&nbsp;If the agent has yet to do a Timeline Battle, you will not be able to play them. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break: normal;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #c00000; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">* Results of friendly matches will not affect your Timeline points. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">3. Other Changes</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;- 'Highest League Rank' tab will be changed to 'League per rank' tab. This tab will allow you to see the highest rankers of every league. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;- In the Timeline Battle menu, you will be able to see your &lsquo;Friend List&rsquo; and &lsquo;Alliance List&rsquo; which will allow you to start a friendly match against them. <br />&nbsp;- The Character Portraits will be replaced by the Icon of their league.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/10.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Timeline Battle Rewards will be shown on the result screen for easy viewing. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141023/11.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;- Bonus rewards granted for playing Timeline Battles have been redesigned.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;- Gold Reward will be added as a possible reward for each league. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6600;\"> World Boss Changes</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">1. Character &#83;elect Window Changes</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- You can sort characters by their Type.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Mastery will be shown on the list.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141024/12.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">2. Choose Allies Window Changes</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- A recent filter has been added to the Striker section of the World Boss menu. If this filter is chosen, recently used characters will be at the top of the list. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141024/13.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6600;\"> Alliance Tournament Changes</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">-Based on the current status of the Alliance Tournament, the tournaments current status will be shown on the Tournament Icon. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141024/14.png\" />&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- You will now be able to see which Alliance you have cheered. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141024/15.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Malgun Gothic'; color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6600;\"> Other Changes</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">1. Tier-2 Characters will be placed on top of the list of Battleworld Entries.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">2. A new &#98;utton has been added to co-op play which will automatically collect rewards.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/03/141024/16.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 27.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: red;\">l<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: red;\">This &#98;utton will still require Clear Tickets to obtain the rewards.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">3. Clear Ticket x10 window animations are now faster.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">4. Tier-2 Characters will be shown on top of your in-game Friend&rsquo;s list of Characters.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">5. You will now be able to check the remaining time of Daily/Weekly missions. This feature will show how much time there is until it resets. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">6. Event list in game will now show how much time is left until the event starts.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">7. In the Alliance Menu, you can now see how much a member has contributed historically (it will no longer reset daily). </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">8. The orange dot notification will no longer show for items that are not purchasable in the Alliance Store. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">9. Fixed an issue with Doctor Strange&rsquo;s Uniform Upgrade that it says insufficient materials in certain situations.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">10. The Following Character&rsquo;s models have been changed:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 10.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Luke Cage, Luke Cage(All-New, All-Different)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 10.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Punisher, Punisher(War Journal)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 10.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Iron Fist(New Avengers), Iron Fist(All-New, All-Different)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 10.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Elektra</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 10.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Captain Marvel(Ms. Marvel)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 10.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Iron Man</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 10.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Sif, Sif(Modern)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 10.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Ultron Prime, Ultron Mark 1</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">11. The orange dot icon has been removed if you have completed all achievements.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">12. Fixed an issue with Character Details menu not including Uniform stats in Gear tab.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">13. Introduction Movie has been removed.&nbsp;</span></p>"
}